  │ How do I reverse a slice in Go?

Meru  direct · 0.91
  ## Reverse a list

  Use **slices.Reverse**. It works in
  place:

  • no copy
  • any element type

    s := []int{1, 2, 3}
    slices.Reverse(s)
    ⧉ copy 1
